#. module: l10n_es_irpf_reconciliation
#: model:mail.template,body_html:l10n_es_irpf_reconciliation.email_template_irpf_annual_discrepancy
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'Administration Team'\"/>,\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-if=\"object.difference != 0\">\n"
"                    When cross-referencing the fiscal data for the <strong>fiscal year <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong> with the Tax Agency (AEAT), we detected a discrepancy in the retentions declared in our favor.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    According to our immutable billing records, the amounts are:\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <ul>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>Withheld IRPF (Odoo):</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>Declared IRPF (AEAT):</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_aeat, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong style=\"color: red;\">Difference to regularize:</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.difference, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                    </ul>\n"
"                    We need your advisory team to review this mismatch and file a complementary declaration.\n"
"                </t>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                    As part of our annual fiscal closing procedures for the <strong>fiscal year <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong>, we are contacting you to request the formal confirmation of the IRPF retentions.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    According to our records, the amounts perfectly match the data declared to the Tax Agency (AEAT):\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <ul>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>Total IRPF Withheld:</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                    </ul>\n"
"                    Everything seems to be correct, but we kindly ask you to formally validate it for our audit records.\n"
"                </t>\n"
"\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Attached you will find the detailed breakdown. Please provide your response using the buttons below:\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                <div style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"                    <a t-att-href=\"object._get_share_url('agree')\" style=\"background-color: #28a745; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n"
"                        I AGREE\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                    <a t-att-href=\"object._get_share_url('disagree')\" style=\"background-color: #dc3545; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 10px;\">\n"
"                        THERE IS AN ERROR\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>By clicking the buttons, your response will be automatically registered in our system.</p>\n"
"                Best regards,\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                Hola <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'Administration Team'\"/>,\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-if=\"object.difference != 0\">\n"
"                    Al cotejar los datos fiscales del <strong>ejercicio fiscal <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong> y los datos remitidos por la  Agencia Tributaria (AEAT), detectamos una discrepancia en las retenciones declaradas a nuestro favor.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    Según nuestros registros de facturación, que son inalterables, los importes son los siguientes:\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <ul>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>IRPF retenido (nuestro sistema):</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>IRPF declarado (AEAT):</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_aeat, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong style=\"color: red;\">Diferencia que hay que regularizar:</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.difference, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                    </ul>\n"
"                    Necesitamos que su equipo asesor revise esta discrepancia y presente una declaración complementaria.\n"
"                </t>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                    Como parte de nuestros procedimientos de cierre fiscal anual para el <strong>ejercicio fiscal <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong>, Nos ponemos en contacto con usted para solicitarle la confirmación oficial de las retenciones del IRPF.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    Según nuestros registros, los importes coinciden perfectamente con los datos declarados a la Agencia Tributaria (AEAT):\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <ul>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            <strong>Total del IRPF retenido:</strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                    </ul>\n"
"                    Todo parece estar correcto, pero le rogamos que lo valide formalmente para nuestros registros de auditoría.\n"
"                </t>\n"
"\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Adjunto encontrará el desglose detallado. Por favor, responda utilizando los botones que aparecen a continuación:\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                <div style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"                    <a t-att-href=\"object._get_share_url('agree')\" style=\"background-color: #28a745; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n"
"                        ESTA CORRECTO\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                    <a t-att-href=\"object._get_share_url('disagree')\" style=\"background-color: #dc3545; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 10px;\">\n"
"                        HAY UN ERROR\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>Al hacer clic en los botones, su respuesta quedará registrada automáticamente en nuestro sistema.</p>\n"
"                Atentamente,\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

#. module: l10n_es_irpf_reconciliation
#: model:mail.template,body_html:l10n_es_irpf_reconciliation.email_template_irpf_quarterly_info
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'Administration Team'\"/>,\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                To facilitate the submission of your tax model this quarter, we inform you of the IRPF retentions\n"
"                recorded in our invoices issued to you during the <strong><t t-out=\"object.period\"/> of the fiscal year <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong>.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Total IRPF Withheld:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                Please check the attached PDF to see the breakdown by invoice.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Please verify that this amount matches your accounting records.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Best regards,\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                Hola <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'Administration Team'\"/>,\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Para facilitar la presentación de su modelo de impuestos de este trimestre, le informamos sobre las retenciones del IRPF\n"
"                que figuran en las facturas que le hemos emitido durante el <strong><t t-out=\"object.period\"/> del ejercicio fiscal <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.fiscal_year\"/></strong>.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Total del IRPF retenido:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_odoo, object.currency_id)\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                Consulte el PDF adjunto para ver el desglose por factura.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Compruebe que este importe coincide con sus registros contables.\n"
"                <br/><br/>\n"
"                Atentamente,\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.audit_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

